		array(
			'slug' => 'google-ai-overviews', 'cpt' => 'tf_guide',
			'title' => 'Google AI Overviews explained',
			'meta_title' => 'Google AI Overviews Explained | Alugence',
			'meta_desc' => 'Google AI Overviews are AI answers at the top of search results. Learn what they are, how they work, and how to get your content featured.',
			'excerpt' => 'Google AI Overviews are AI-generated summaries that appear at the top of Google search results, answering a query directly and citing a handful of sources. They\'re powered by Google\'s Gemini models and aim to give a fast answer before the traditional list of links.',
			'faqs' => array(array('What are Google AI Overviews?','Google AI Overviews are AI-generated answer summaries shown at the top of Google search results. They answer the query directly and cite a few sources, powered by Google\'s Gemini models, aiming to give a fast answer before the usual links.'),array('How do I get my content into AI Overviews?','Answer target questions clearly and early, structure content with headings, lists and FAQ sections, add relevant schema, and build genuine topical authority and E-E-A-T. Content must also be technically accessible and trustworthy. This is what AEO optimises for.'),array('Do AI Overviews reduce website traffic?','They can reduce clicks for simple queries answered on the page, but being cited in an Overview still earns visibility and qualified visits. The impact varies by query type; the best response is to optimise to be the cited source and track your AI presence.'),array('Which queries show AI Overviews?','Google shows AI Overviews more often for informational and how-to queries, and less for navigational or highly transactional ones, though coverage keeps expanding. Question-based queries are especially likely to trigger an Overview.')),
			'html' => '<nav class="on-this-page" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#what">What they are</a> · <a href="#how">How they work</a> · <a href="#appear">How to appear in AI Overviews</a> · <a href="#impact">Impact on traffic</a> · <a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></nav>
<h2 id="what">What are Google AI Overviews?</h2>
<p>Google AI Overviews are AI-written answer boxes shown above (or among) standard search results for many queries. Each Overview summarises an answer and links to a small number of cited sources. They represent Google\'s move from a list of links toward direct, AI-generated answers.</p>
<h2 id="how">How do AI Overviews work?</h2>
<p>An AI Overview is generated by retrieving relevant, trusted web content and using Google\'s Gemini models to compose a concise answer, with citations to the sources used. Google shows them selectively — more often for informational and how-to queries, less for navigational or highly commercial ones. Being <em>cited</em> in an Overview depends on having clear, extractable, authoritative content.</p>
<h2 id="appear">How to appear in Google AI Overviews</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Answer the question clearly and early</strong> — lead sections with a concise, self-contained answer.</li><li><strong>Structure content well</strong> — question-format headings, short paragraphs, lists, tables, FAQ blocks.</li><li><strong>Add schema</strong> — FAQPage and Article schema help clarify your content.</li><li><strong>Build topical authority and E-E-A-T</strong> — depth, named authors, cited sources.</li><li><strong>Stay technically accessible</strong> — crawlable, fast, server-rendered content.</li></ul>
<p>This is the core of <a href="/ai-search/answer-engine-optimisation/">answer engine optimisation (AEO)</a>.</p>
<h2 id="impact">What AI Overviews mean for your traffic</h2>
<p>AI Overviews can reduce clicks for queries fully answered on the results page, while being <em>cited</em> in an Overview can still drive qualified visits and brand exposure. The strategic response is to optimise to be the cited source and to focus on queries where users still need to click through — and to track how your presence in AI answers changes over time.</p>
<h2>Win AI Overview placements</h2>
<p>Alugence\'s <a href="/ai-search/answer-engine-optimisation/">AEO services</a> help your content become the cited answer. <a href="/contact/">Book an audit</a>.</p>',
