			'title' => 'What is AI search?',
			'meta_title' => 'What is AI Search? ChatGPT, Gemini & Perplexity',
			'meta_desc' => 'AI search is how AI engines answer questions directly instead of listing links. Learn what AI search is, how it works, and why it matters.',
			'excerpt' => 'AI search is a way of finding information where an AI engine understands your question and generates a direct answer — often citing sources — instead of returning a list of links. ChatGPT, Google Gemini, Google AI Overviews, Perplexity and Microsoft Copilot are all forms of AI search.',
			'faqs' => array(array('What is AI search in simple terms?','AI search is when an AI engine answers your question directly — in conversational language, often with sources — instead of giving you a list of links to click. Examples include ChatGPT, Google\'s AI Overviews, Gemini and Perplexity.'),array('How is AI search different from Google search?','Traditional Google search returns a ranked list of links for you to explore; AI search generates a direct answer to your question, sometimes citing sources. Google now blends both, showing AI Overviews above the classic links.'),array('What is an AI search engine?','An AI search engine is a tool that uses AI to understand a query and produce a direct, generated answer — usually by retrieving current information and composing a response with a language model. ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Copilot are examples.'),array('Will AI search replace traditional search?','It\'s blending with it rather than replacing it outright — Google now shows AI answers alongside links, and many users move between both. The practical shift for brands is that being cited in AI answers now matters alongside ranking in classic results.'),array('How do I make my brand appear in AI search?','Make your brand easy for AI engines to understand, extract and trust — through entity consistency, schema, answer-first content, crawler access and citations — then track your presence. See how to improve brand visibility in AI search.')),
			'html' => '<nav class="on-this-page" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#def">Definition</a> · <a href="#how">How it works</a> · <a href="#engines">The main AI search engines</a> · <a href="#brands">Why it matters for brands</a> · <a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></nav>
<h2 id="def">What AI search means</h2>
<p>AI search is the use of artificial intelligence — particularly large language models — to answer queries conversationally and directly. Rather than making you scan ten blue links, an AI search engine reads your question, retrieves relevant information, and composes a single answer, often with citations. It\'s a fundamental change in how people find and choose things.</p>
<h2 id="how">How does AI search work?</h2>
<p>Most AI search combines two techniques: <strong>retrieval</strong> (finding relevant, current information from the web or a database) and <strong>generation</strong> (using a language model to compose an answer from it). This "retrieval-augmented generation" lets engines give up-to-date, sourced answers. The engine decides which sources to trust and cite — which is exactly what <a href="/guides/what-is-geo/">GEO</a> and <a href="/guides/what-is-aeo/">AEO</a> aim to influence.</p>
<h2 id="engines">The main AI search engines</h2>
<ul><li><strong>ChatGPT (with search)</strong> — conversational answers with web citations.</li><li><strong>Google AI Overviews &amp; AI Mode</strong> — AI answers at the top of Google results (<a href="/guides/google-ai-overviews/">AI Overviews guide</a>, <a href="/guides/google-ai-mode/">AI Mode guide</a>).</li><li><strong>Google Gemini</strong> — Google\'s conversational AI.</li><li><strong>Perplexity</strong> — an answer engine built around cited sources (<a href="/guides/perplexity-optimisation/">Perplexity guide</a>).</li><li><strong>Microsoft Copilot</strong> — AI search across Bing and Windows.</li></ul>
<h2 id="brands">Why AI search matters for brands</h2>
<p>As users get answers without clicking, being <em>cited in the answer</em> becomes the new visibility. Brands that aren\'t mentioned by AI search engines lose reach even if they rank in classic search. That\'s why measuring and improving <a href="/ai-search/ai-search-visibility/">AI search visibility</a> is becoming essential.</p>
<h2>Get found in AI search</h2>
<p>Alugence helps brands appear and get cited across AI search engines. Explore <a href="/ai-search/">AI search consultancy</a> or <a href="/contact/">book a call</a>.</p>',
