		array(
			'slug' => 'what-is-generative-ai', 'cpt' => 'tf_guide',
			'title' => 'What is generative AI?',
			'meta_title' => 'What is Generative AI? Definition & Examples',
			'meta_desc' => 'Generative AI creates new content — text, images, code — from patterns it has learned. Learn what generative AI is, how it works and its uses.',
			'excerpt' => 'Generative AI is a type of artificial intelligence that creates new content — text, images, audio, video or code — based on patterns learned from large amounts of training data. Tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and image generators are all examples of generative AI.',
			'faqs' => array(array('What is generative AI in simple terms?','Generative AI is AI that creates new content — like text, images or code — in response to a prompt, based on patterns it learned during training. ChatGPT and Claude are common examples: you ask, and they generate an original answer.'),array('What is the difference between generative AI and traditional AI?','Traditional AI typically analyses or classifies existing data — for example, predicting or detecting. Generative AI creates new content. Both are useful; generative AI is what powers chatbots, content tools and much of today\'s AI search.'),array('What is a large language model (LLM)?','A large language model is a type of generative AI trained on huge amounts of text to understand and produce human-like language. LLMs like Claude and GPT power chatbots, assistants and AI search. See our glossary entry.'),array('Is generative AI safe for business use?','Yes, when used responsibly — with appropriate tools, data controls, human review of outputs, and governance. Risks like inaccuracy and data exposure are manageable with the right guardrails. See AI governance.'),array('What can generative AI be used for in business?','It\'s used for drafting content and documents, customer service chatbots, summarising information, writing and reviewing code, and powering AI agents for multi-step tasks. The highest returns usually come from automating repetitive, language-heavy work.')),
			'html' => '<nav class="on-this-page" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#def">Definition</a> · <a href="#how">How it works</a> · <a href="#examples">Examples</a> · <a href="#uses">Business uses</a> · <a href="#faqs">FAQs</a></nav>
<h2 id="def">What generative AI means</h2>
<p>Generative AI is AI that generates original content rather than only analysing or classifying existing data. Given a prompt, it produces something new — a written answer, an image, a snippet of code — that reflects the patterns in its training data. The best-known generative AI tools are large language models (LLMs) such as Claude and GPT.</p>
<h2 id="how">How does generative AI work?</h2>
<p>Generative AI models are trained on vast datasets to learn the statistical patterns of language, images or other data. When you prompt them, they predict and assemble a plausible response one piece at a time. Large language models specifically predict text; when connected to live data (retrieval), they can also give current, sourced answers — the basis of <a href="/guides/what-is-ai-search/">AI search</a>.</p>
<h2 id="examples">Examples of generative AI</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Text:</strong> ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini — writing, summarising, answering.</li><li><strong>Images:</strong> tools that create pictures from text descriptions.</li><li><strong>Code:</strong> AI coding assistants that write and explain software.</li><li><strong>Audio &amp; video:</strong> voice generation and video synthesis.</li></ul>
<h2 id="uses">How businesses use generative AI</h2>
<p>Businesses use generative AI to draft documents and content, power <a href="/ai-consultancy/ai-chatbots/">chatbots and assistants</a>, summarise information, generate code, and build <a href="/guides/what-is-agentic-ai/">AI agents</a> that complete multi-step tasks. Deployed well — with governance and training — it can meaningfully lift productivity. See <a href="/guides/ai-for-business/">AI for business</a>.</p>
<h2>Put generative AI to work</h2>
<p>Alugence helps businesses adopt generative AI safely and productively. Explore <a href="/ai-consultancy/">AI consultancy</a> or <a href="/contact/">book a call</a>.</p>',
		),
